    "Scan of the 1962 edition of the Hialeah, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the Department of Commerce. Surveyed in 1946; aerial photographs from 1969; field checked in 1962; photo inspected in 1981; photo revised in 1969; printed in 1984.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 23 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
